## 1. `OfcFulfillmentEventHandler.handleBiz()` -- 消息总闸三分支 + 排程分流

**路径**: `scm-workbench-service/src/main/java/com/ke/utopia/scm/workbench/service/mq/listener/handler/OfcFulfillmentEventHandler.java`

**方法签名**:
```java
@Override
public void handleBiz(OfcFulfillmentNodePayload payloadData, String eventContextKey)
```

**片段 A -- handleBiz 主体中的排程分流（isScheduleProject / queryProjectInScheduleSwitch）：**

主材任务节点收到消息后，先判断是否在排程配置中，从而分流到旧考核或新排程考核：

```java
// 只有依赖用工条件的旧考核, 才会走这里
// 依赖用工的新考核, 在监听主材任务消息的位置处理
Boolean isInScheduleConfig;
try {
    isInScheduleConfig = edarStarlordRpc.queryProjectInScheduleSwitch(projectOrderId);
} catch (Exception e) {
    LOGGER.info("OfcFulfillmentEventHandler获取排程配置开关失败, projectOrderId:{}, err:", projectOrderId, e);
    throw new ServiceException(ServiceExceptionEnum.RPC_CALL_FAILURE.getCode(), "获取配置开关失败", e);
}

if (!isInScheduleConfig) {
    FigureParam figureParam = indicatorDAGService.transEventNodeByOrder(null, projectOrderId, categoryId, payloadData.getActionType());
    if (figureParam == null) {
        LOGGER.info("未查询到需要计算的事件节点");
        return;
    }
    LOGGER.info("doExecute开始计算ofc节点信息, projectId:{}, startNode: {}, extNode: {}",
            figureParam.getProjectOrderNo(),
            figureParam.getStartNodes().stream().map(EventNode::getCode).collect(Collectors.toList()),
            figureParam.getExtNodes().stream().map(EventNode::getCode).collect(Collectors.joining(","))
    );
    evalOrderService.calculateIndicatorByEvents(figureParam.getProjectOrderNo(), figureParam.getStartNodes(), figureParam.getExtNodes());
}
```

**片段 B -- doExecute 方法中排程/非排程分流的完整逻辑：**

```java
public void doExecute(String flowMainNo, OfcFulfillmentNodePayload payloadData, Boolean isInSchedule) {
    Transaction transaction = Cat.newTransaction("ofcNodeInfoCalculate", "doExecute");
    try {
        transaction.addData("orderNo=" + flowMainNo + "&actionType=" + payloadData.getActionType());
        IndicatorOrderBO orderBo = indicatorOrderService.buildOrderBo(flowMainNo, payloadData);

        // 排程初始化数据白名单
        Boolean scheduleInit = indicatorScheduleDAGService.isScheduleProject(orderBo.getProjectOrderId());

        if (isInSchedule || scheduleInit) {
            // 排程新配置考核, 或者排程数据白名单
            FigureScheduleParam scheduleParam = indicatorScheduleDAGService.transEventNodeByOrder(flowMainNo, null, null, payloadData.getActionType());
            if (scheduleParam != null) {
                LOGGER.info("doExecute开始计算ofc节点信息, projectId:{}, startNode: {}",
                        scheduleParam.getProjectOrderId(),
                        scheduleParam.getStartNodes().stream().map(ScheduleEventNode::getUniqCode).collect(Collectors.toList()));
                // 按照新配置计算考核, isInScheduleConfig情况下数据同步给主材任务
                evalScheduleOrderService.calculateScheduleIndicatorByEvents(scheduleParam.getProjectOrderId(), scheduleParam.getStartNodes(), scheduleParam.getExtNodes(), isInSchedule);
                transaction.setStatus(Transaction.SUCCESS);
            }
        }
        if (!isInSchedule) {
            // 未命中新排程配置, 使用旧考核
            if (noMatchRule(orderBo.getCategoryId(), orderBo.getBusinessType(), orderBo.getSecondType(), orderBo.getBusinessVersion())) {
                LOGGER.info("未查询到满足的考核规则, 无需计算");
                transaction.setStatus(Transaction.SUCCESS);
                return;
            }
            FigureParam figureParam = indicatorDAGService.transEventNodeByOrder(flowMainNo, null, null, payloadData.getActionType());
            if (figureParam == null) {
                LOGGER.info("未查询到需要计算的事件节点");
                transaction.setStatus(Transaction.SUCCESS);
                return;
            }
            evalOrderService.calculateIndicatorByEvents(figureParam.getProjectOrderNo(), figureParam.getStartNodes(), figureParam.getExtNodes());
        }
        transaction.setStatus(Transaction.SUCCESS);
    } catch (OrderBuildException obe) {
        transaction.setStatus(obe);
    } catch (Exception e) {
        transaction.setStatus(e);
    } finally {
        transaction.complete();
    }
}
```

**一句话说明**: 收到 OFC 货单消息后先通过 `queryProjectInScheduleSwitch`/`isScheduleProject` 判断项目是否接入排程；接入排程则走 `evalScheduleOrderService.calculateScheduleIndicatorByEvents`（新模型），否则走 `evalOrderService.calculateIndicatorByEvents`（旧模型）；两个分支均调用 `doExecuteGenerateTask` 生成接单/备货/进仓任务，`doExecuteModifyTask` 根据 actionType 更新任务状态。

