@EntryTrace
@KafkaListener(topics = {"ofc-fulfillment-node"}, containerFactory = "${kafka.config.common-queue-01.consumer.properties.listener-names}")
public void assignInstaller(ConsumerRecord<Long, String> record, Acknowledgment acknowledgment) {
    if (record == null || StringUtils.isBlank(record.value())) {
        return;
    }
    Optional<?> kafkaMessage = Optional.ofNullable(record.value());
    try {
        if (kafkaMessage.isPresent()) {
            Object message = kafkaMessage.get();
            eventDrivenSubscriberV2.persistAndHandleMessage((String) message);
        }
    } catch (Exception e) {
        logger.error("消费[ofc-fulfillment-node]出错,msg:{}", e.getMessage(),e);
    } finally {
        acknowledgment.acknowledge();
    }
}
```

**一句话说明**: 通过 `@KafkaListener(topics = "ofc-fulfillment-node")` 接收 OFC 履行节点变更消息，将 JSON payload 转交给 `EventDrivenSubscriberV2.persistAndHandleMessage()` 做落地和派发；无论成功或失败最终均 `acknowledge()`。

