## 3. `EventDrivenSubscriberV2.persistAndHandleMessage()` -- 消息落库 + 幂等 + dispatch

**路径**: `scm-workbench-service/src/main/java/com/ke/utopia/scm/workbench/service/mq/EventDrivenSubscriberV2.java`

**方法签名**:
```java
public void persistAndHandleMessage(String payload)
```

**代码片段**:
```java
public void persistAndHandleMessage(String payload) {
    Assert.notNull(payload, "persistAndHandleMessage businessType not Null");
    Event event = Jacksons.readValue(payload, Event.class);
    //不包含直接返回
    if (!checkContainEventType(event.getEventType())) {
        return;
    }
    //环境不匹配记录日志并返回，仅配置项 sameEnvLimit 为 true 有效
    if (!checkSameEventEnv(event, eventDrivenProperties)) {
        LOGGER.warn("reject event: {}, reason: not same env. subscriber env: {}", event, eventDrivenProperties.getServerGroup());
        return;
    }
    EventSub eventSub = convertEventSub(event);
    if (this.saveNewEvent(eventSub)) {
        this.doSubscribeWithoutTransaction(eventSub);
    }
}

private boolean saveNewEvent(EventSub eventSub) {
    try {
        EventSubExample eventSubExample = new EventSubExample();
        eventSubExample.createCriteria()
                .andEventIdEqualTo(eventSub.getEventId())
                .andEventGroupEqualTo(eventSub.getEventGroup())
                .andEventServiceEqualTo(eventSub.getEventService());
        List<EventSub> eventSubs = eventSubMapper.selectByExample(eventSubExample);
        if (CollectionUtils.isNotEmpty(eventSubs)) {
            return false;
        }
        // 数据过长时截断
        String originData = eventSub.getPayloadData();
        if (!StringUtils.isEmpty(eventSub.getPayloadData()) && eventSub.getPayloadData().length() > MAX_DATA_LENGTH) {
            eventSub.setPayloadData(eventSub.getPayloadData().substring(0, MAX_DATA_LENGTH));
        }
        int rows = eventSubMapper.insertSelective(eventSub);
        eventSub.setPayloadData(originData);
        return rows > 0;
    } catch (DuplicateKeyException dke) {
        LOGGER.warn("消息重复:, {}", JSONObject.toJSONString(eventSub), dke);
    }
    return false;
}

public void doSubscribeWithoutTransaction(EventSub eventSub) {
    try {
        eventDispatcher.dispatch(eventSub, true);
        int result = this.eventSubMapper.updateEventStatusByPrimaryKeyInCasMode(eventSub.getId(), eventSub.getEventStatus(), EventStatus.DONE.getType());
        LOGGER.info("event id {} result {} execute success.", eventSub.getEventId(), result);
        eventDrivenSubHookManager.executeSubSuccess(eventSub);
    } catch (Exception e) {
        int result = this.eventSubMapper.updateEventStatusByPrimaryKeyInCasMode(eventSub.getId(), eventSub.getEventStatus(), EventStatus.ERROR.getType());
        LOGGER.error("event id {} result {} execute error.", eventSub.getEventId(), result, e);
        eventDrivenSubHookManager.executeSubError(eventSub, e);
    }
}
```

**一句话说明**: 将 Kafka 消息反序列化为 `Event`，查 `event_sub` 表做幂等去重（按 eventId+eventGroup+eventService），没有重复则 `insertSelective` 落库，然后 `eventDispatcher.dispatch()` 派发给 `OfcFulfillmentEventHandler.handleBiz()` 处理，处理完成 CAS 更新状态为 DONE/ERROR。

