## 4. `EvalOrderService.calculateIndicatorByEvents()` -- 旧模型计算主流程

**路径**: `scm-workbench-service/src/main/java/com/ke/utopia/scm/workbench/service/write/EvalOrderService.java`

**方法签名**:
