## 2. FulfillmentTaskServiceMapping -- taskType -> Service 映射注册

**文件路径:** `scm-workbench-service/src/main/java/com/ke/utopia/scm/workbench/service/service/fulfillmentTask/TaskService/FulfillmentTaskServiceMapping.java`

```java
@Service
public class FulfillmentTaskServiceMapping {

    @Autowired
    private ApplicationContext applicationContext;

    private static final HashMap<Integer,String> mapping;

    private static final String defaultTaskService = "BaseTaskService";

    static {
        mapping = new HashMap<>();
        mapping.put(FulfillmentTaskTypeEnum.DESIGN_REVIEW.getTypeCode(), "DesignReviewTaskService");
        mapping.put(FulfillmentTaskTypeEnum.NOTICE_READY_TO_DELIVERY.getTypeCode(), "NotifyDeliveryTaskService");
        mapping.put(FulfillmentTaskTypeEnum.DELIVERY_GOODS.getTypeCode(), "DeliveryGoodTaskService");
        mapping.put(FulfillmentTaskTypeEnum.QUOTATION_TASK.getTypeCode(), "QuotationTaskService");
        mapping.put(FulfillmentTaskTypeEnum.QUOTATION_ACCEPTANCE_TASK.getTypeCode(), "QuotationAcceptanceTaskService");
        mapping.put(FulfillmentTaskTypeEnum.INSTALL_READY_TO_SIGN.getTypeCode(), "InstallTaskSignService");
        mapping.put(FulfillmentTaskTypeEnum.PRE_INSTALL_READY_TO_SIGN.getTypeCode(), "InstallTaskSignService");
        mapping.put(FulfillmentTaskTypeEnum.NOTICE_PLACE_ORDER.getTypeCode(), "NoticePlaceOrderService");
        mapping.put(FulfillmentTaskTypeEnum.APPLY_RESCALE.getTypeCode(), "ApplyRescaleTaskService");
    }

    public AbstractTaskService getServiceByTaskType(FulfillmentTask fulfillmentTask) {
        String taskServiceName = mapping.getOrDefault(fulfillmentTask.getTaskType(), defaultTaskService);
        return (AbstractTaskService) applicationContext.getBean(taskServiceName);
    }
}
```

说明：static 块中维护 taskType 编码到 Spring Bean 名称的映射表，未命中时走默认 BaseTaskService。`getServiceByTaskType()` 通过 ApplicationContext.getBean() 获取对应的 AbstractTaskService 子类实例。

