@Trace
@EventListener
@Async("IndicatorChangeMsgExecutor")
public void handleIndicatorChangedEvent(IndicatorChangedEvent event) {
    try {
        LOGGER.info("handleIndicatorChangedEvent eventMsg={}", JsonUtil.obj2JsonStr(event));
        List<IndicatorEvalValBO.IndicatorEvalSDO> baseEval = event.getBaseEval() != null ? event.getBaseEval() : new ArrayList<>();
        List<IndicatorEvalValBO.IndicatorEvalSDO> cusEval = event.getCusEval() != null ? event.getCusEval() : new ArrayList<>();
        Map<String, IndicatorEvalValBO.IndicatorEvalSDO> baseEvalMap = baseEval.stream()
                .collect(Collectors.toMap(IndicatorEvalValBO.IndicatorEvalSDO::getIndicatorName, Function.identity(), (v1, v2) -> v1));
        Map<String, IndicatorEvalValBO.IndicatorEvalSDO> cusEvalMap = cusEval.stream()
                .collect(Collectors.toMap(IndicatorEvalValBO.IndicatorEvalSDO::getIndicatorName, Function.identity(), (v1, v2) -> v1));
        Set<String> updatedEval = event.getUpdatedEval();
        // 闸门1：updatedEval 为空则不发送
        if (updatedEval.isEmpty()) {
            LOGGER.info("handleIndicatorChangedEvent updatedEval is empty");
            return;
        }
        // ... 构建 indicatorChangePayload ...

        // 闸门3：按区域及订单创建时间控制（synEffectiveTime 灰度开关）
        if (event.getOrderCreateTime().compareTo(synEffectiveTime) >= 0 && checkValidToProducer(event)) {
            LOGGER.info("同步主材任务考核时间,orderNo is{},param is {}",orderNo, JsonUtil.obj2JsonStr(indicatorChangePayload));
            PayLoadData<IndicatorChangePayload> payLoadData = new PayLoadData<>(
                    MessageBizTypeConst.INDICATOR_CHANGED,
                    indicatorChangePayload.getOrderNo(),
                    indicatorChangePayload
            );
            producers.send(payLoadData);
        }
    } catch (Exception e) {
        LOGGER.error("handleIndicatorChangedEvent error, eventMsg={}, error={}", event, e.getMessage(), e);
    }
}

// 闸门2：北京黑名单过滤
private Boolean checkValidToProducer(IndicatorChangedEvent event) {
    List<String> syncQvyvBlackList = new ArrayList<>(Arrays.asList(apolloConfig.getQvyuBlackList().split(",")));
    if (!syncQvyvBlackList.contains(event.getQvyu()) || TaskModeEnum.SCHEDULE.getTaskMode().equals(event.getTaskMode())) {
        return true;
    }
    if (event.getProjectOrderId() != null) {
        ProjectOrderDto projectOrderDto = projectOrderRpc.getByProjectOrderId(event.getProjectOrderId());
        if ("hardcover_house".equals(projectOrderDto.getFulfillmentMode())) { return true; }
        String projectVersion = ProjectVersionUtil.getProjectVersionDetail(projectOrderDto);
        if (ProjectVersionUtil.V2_5_group_whole.equals(projectVersion)
                || ProjectVersionUtil.V2_5_group_quan.equals(projectVersion)) { return true; }
        if (ProjectVersionUtil.V2_5_partial_decoration.equals(projectVersion)) { return true; }
    }
    return false;
}
```

说明：三道闸门控制是否发送 Kafka 消息：(1) updatedEval 为空直接 return；(2) `checkValidToProducer()` 中检查北京黑名单（syncQvyvBlackList），排程/精装全案/团装/翻新可豁免；(3) 订单创建时间 >= synEffectiveTime（Apollo 灰度开关）。通过后构建 IndicatorChangePayload 并通过 producers.send() 发到 topic `workbench_indicator_change`。

