## 8. Producers / persistPublishMessage -- 可靠发送

**文件路径:** `scm-workbench-service/src/main/java/com/ke/utopia/scm/workbench/service/mq/producer/Producers.java`

```java
@Component
@Slf4j
public class Producers {

    @Resource
    private EventDrivenPublisher eventDrivenPublisher;

    @Value("${kafka.config.common-queue-02.producer.properties.indicator-change.topic:workbench_indicator_change}")
    private String topic;

    @Value("${kafka.topic.fullfill_node_change:fulfill_node_change}")
    private String fullFillNodeChangeTopic;

    @Value("${kafka.topic.schedule_data_recovery:schedule_data_recovery}")
    private String scheduleTopic;

    @PostConstruct
    public void init() {
        EventDrivenPublisher.registerType(new String[]{MessageBizTypeConst.INDICATOR_CHANGED}, new KafkaMessageRoute(topic));
        EventDrivenPublisher.registerType(new String[]{MessageBizTypeConst.FULFILL_NODE_CHANGE}, new KafkaMessageRoute(fullFillNodeChangeTopic));
        EventDrivenPublisher.registerType(new String[]{MessageBizTypeConst.SCHEDULE_ASSESSMENT, MessageBizTypeConst.SCHEDULE_TASK}, new KafkaMessageRoute(scheduleTopic));
    }

    public <T> void send(PayLoadData<T> payLoadData) {
        if (payLoadData == null) { return; }
        LOGGER.info("==>>>发送消息，待发送的消息：payload = {}", JsonUtils.obj2JsonStr(payLoadData));
        try {
            this.eventDrivenPublisher.persistPublishMessage(payLoadData.getData(), payLoadData.getBizType(), payLoadData.getContextKey());
        } catch (Exception e) {
            LOGGER.error("==>>>发送消息失败", e);
        }
    }
}
```

说明：Producers 封装 EventDrivenPublisher（来自事件驱动框架），init() 中注册了三个 topic 路由。send() 调用 `persistPublishMessage()` —— 该方法实现"先落 event_pub 表，后发 Kafka"的可靠发送语义。业务方只需构造 PayLoadData 并调用 send() 即可。

