```java
public void doSyncOFWTask(FulfillmentTask fulfillmentTask, TaskOperationContext taskOperationContext) {
    fulfillmentExecutor.execute(() -> {
        // 供应商模式不同步ofw
        if (FulfillmentServiceTaskType.SUPPLIER.getTypeCode().equals(fulfillmentTask.getServiceTaskType())
                || RoleTypeEnum.SUPPLIER.getCode().equals(fulfillmentTask.getRole())) { return; }
        // 下服务单之后, 不同步ofw
        if (StringUtils.isNotEmpty(fulfillmentTask.getReceiptNo()) && fulfillmentTask.getReceiptNo().startsWith("FT")) { return; }
        if (!taskOperationContext.getTargetStatusEnum().equals(FulfillmentTaskStatusEnum.FINISHED)
                && !taskOperationContext.getTargetStatusEnum().equals(FulfillmentTaskStatusEnum.REVIEWING)) { return; }

        SubOrderEventEnum subOrderEventEnum = null;
        switch (taskOperationContext.getTargetStatusEnum()) {
            case FINISHED:    subOrderEventEnum = SubOrderEventEnum.ACCEPTANCE_PASSED;    break;
            case REVIEWING:   subOrderEventEnum = SubOrderEventEnum.SERVICE_COMPLETED;    break;
        }

        SyncServerOrderStatusParam syncServerOrderStatusParam = new SyncServerOrderStatusParam();
        syncServerOrderStatusParam.setServiceOrderNo(fulfillmentTask.getReceiptNo());
        syncServerOrderStatusParam.setOperationTime(taskOperationContext.getOperationTime());
        syncServerOrderStatusParam.setOperation(subOrderEventEnum.getKey());

        try {
            LOGGER.info("同步OFW系统参数:{}", syncServerOrderStatusParam);
            ofcRpc.syncServerTaskStatus(syncServerOrderStatusParam);
        } catch (Exception e) {
            LOGGER.error("同步OFW系统失败", e);
        }
    });
}
```

说明：SyncVssTaskService 在任务创建/状态变更时将设计/报价变更任务同步到 VSS 供应商系统，调用 vssRpc.addServiceOrderInfo / updateServiceOrderInfoByOrderNo；SyncOFWTaskService 在任务 REVIEWING/FINISHED 时通过 ofcRpc.syncServerTaskStatus 将服务单状态同步到 OFW 系统（使用异步线程池 fulfillmentExecutor）。

