public void delRule(Integer sourceType, Long sourceId) {
    IndicatorComputeRuleExample example = new IndicatorComputeRuleExample();
    example.createCriteria().andSourceTypeEqualTo(sourceType).andSourceIdEqualTo(sourceId);
    List<IndicatorComputeRule> indicatorComputeRules = indicatorComputeRuleMapper.selectByExample(example);
    if (CollectionUtils.isNotEmpty(indicatorComputeRules)) {
        Long versionId = redoLogService.saveRedoLog(null, indicatorComputeRules);
        indicatorComputeRules.forEach(rule -> {
            this.indicatorHistoryService.saveLog(versionId, rule.getSourceType().equals(0) ? 2 : 3, null, rule);
            this.indicatorComputeRuleDao.delete(rule.getId());
        });
    }
}
```

说明：根据 `sourceType` 区分底线(`BASE`) / 一城一策(`CUS`)，软删对应的配置主表记录；`CUS` 时额外删除关联的 `indicator_branch_config`；最后调 `delRule` 删除 `indicator_compute_rule` 中的计算规则并记日志。

